      "verdict": {
        "ticker": "AXTI",
        "stance": "accumulate",
        "previousStance": "accumulate",
        "view": "Held at accumulate, and the verified numbers are better than the desk knew when it entered on 12 August. Q2 revenue was a record $47.6M, up 164% year over year and 77% sequentially, with indium phosphide at a record $30.7M, and non-GAAP gross margin at 45.0% against 8.2% a year earlier \u2014 a genuine operating inflection, not a story. Management plans to more than double InP capacity in 2026 toward a $60M quarterly run rate and $130M quarterly by end-2027. Two cautions on his framing. First, the InP price-hike article he posted is Taiwan-centric and names VPEC, Landmark and IET as the beneficiaries \u2014 his own source credits AXT's competitors, so the price signal is industry-wide rather than AXT-specific. Second, and more important, every wafer is made by Beijing Tongmei inside China across three sites, and InP has been under Chinese export control since February 2025, with permits granted customer by customer; AXT has said germanium permits for sales outside China are difficult to obtain and that certain customers prefer to source substrates outside China. The shortage is real and AXT benefits from it, but its access to Western customers runs through Beijing's licensing regime at exactly the moment this supply chain is being re-shored.",
        "execution": "Hold the 12 August entry at $73.78; it is flat since. Add only below $60, and cap this at a starter-sized position regardless of momentum \u2014 the position size, not the entry price, is where the export-control risk gets managed.",
        "changesMind": "A Chinese export-control action restricting InP substrate shipments to US or Taiwanese customers would break this outright. In the other direction, AXT qualifying meaningful InP capacity outside China would remove the single largest risk and justify sizing up.",
        "basedOnThesisIds": [
          "x_2089165155741622679",
          "x_2088947694886920409",
          "x_2087838176677376186"
        ],
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-21T09:00:00Z"
      }
