      "text": "$AXTI\n enters long term agreement with \n$LITE\n for InP substrates. \n\nLumentum has agreed to pay a deposit of $43.5M as a reservation for capacity.\n\n$AXTI\n secured LTA with \n$COHR\n earlier, with a $22.3M reservation payment.\n\nAs well as a LTA with \n$LITE\n today, totaling $87M ($43.5M + $43.5M) again to reserve capacity. \n\nConsidering that these are both of the two leading optical players, seems positive. \n\nThe actual details such as pricing of the contracts aren't known, so we'll find out more.",
