      "ingestedAt": "2026-08-03T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "Semiconductor expert: The CPO adoption claim rests on channel checks and a Rosenblatt note, not on any AMD disclosure. Helios and MI450 ship in H2 2026 on pluggable optics; co-packaged optics is described as a future-generation option, which puts any AAOI or Sivers read-through in 2027 at the earliest.",
