      "text": "Semiconductor expert: The FCC import-ban read-through is regulatory, not technical, and Agility's Digit is a warehouse logistics biped rather than a quadruped or general-purpose humanoid. Whether the named category captures Agility's addressable market is not established by any primary source I can cite.",
