      "text": "It was reported today that Leopold\u2019s Situational Awareness acquired 11.62% of Taiyo Yuden (6976).\n\nUp from 5.99% as of July 16th. \n\nI do agree with his position (if he still has it) in terms of how valuable this MLCC manufacturer is to global AI supply chains. https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087397768314999183",
