      "postedAt": "2026-08-12T06:22:14Z",
      "ingestedAt": "2026-08-13T04:55:29Z",
      "text": "What a legend, Situational Awareness bought 1/6th of the entire company of Taiyo Yuden.\n\nPretty wild to see this unfolding. https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087424400811507963",
      "tickers": [],
