        "note": "Broadcom crossed from watch into the Core [[conviction-tier]] in the 21 Aug 2026 review on accumulated mentions rather than on a fresh argument \u2014 a useful reminder that the score measures [[aleabitoreddit]]'s posting behaviour, not the desk's judgement.\n\nHe names it in two distinct roles. It is a custom-accelerator counterweight to [[nvda]] in the hyperscaler ASIC race alongside [[mrvl]], and separately he lists it among the remaining Western CW laser players in [[photonics]] \u2014 hedged with 'maybe', alongside [[aaoi]], [[mtsi]] and [[smtc]]. Neither is a developed thesis in this corpus, and the desk has never written a verdict on it. It sits just outside the top-fifteen roster line.",
